<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">- Doondo</book>
  <para style="h">YUDE</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yud</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yuda</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda wu Yude</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda wusonika</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yude</para>
  <para style="imt">Nkotolo</para>
  <para style="ip">Wu ni mukanda wusonika Yude. Yesu ni kihunda kyandi na Zaki. Mukanda bewuwu wuna fwanakana na mukanda wunzole wusonika Petelo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yude wusonika mukanda bewuwu kuu bantu Nzambi ba kasoola. Wubateela mu keba kwawu mu yobobo bakwe longanga bantu misamu mii miswaswana na Mambu Mambote. Nkadulu yimbi yi bantu bebobo yikwe lonkanga ti bavwihulu ku Yesu ko. Wubateela dyaka nki Nzambi kakwe sanga ku yobobo bakwe lembolo hidikanga misamu mimbote.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndandani yi mukanda bewuwu ebu yidi:</para>
  <para style="io1">1) Zimbote (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JUD 1:1-2">1-2</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">2) Nsukunu yi milongisi mi luvunu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JUD 1:3-23">3-23</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">3) Lusambulu lumanunu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JUD 1:24-25">24-25</ref></char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="s1">Zimbote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />Meno, Yude mundongo wu Yesu Klisto, mpangi yi zaki, ku yeno bantu, Nzambi Tata bakatumisa na bakatiidi mpe bakwe kebongo ku Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="JUD 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Bika ti nkenda, kiyenge na luzolo bitoma nyeka ku yeno!<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Milongi mi luvunu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2PE 2:1-17">2 Pet 2.1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Mpangi zani zizola, na bedi na nsatu yi vudidi kitezo mu lusonikina, mu dyambu ditadidi mpulusu yii neto kintwadi. Kansi nayeni bumbote mu lusonikina mukanda bewuwu, mwanki na lusyamisa mu nwana mu dyambu di kiminu ki haana Nzambi ku bantu bamvimba bakavwidi.<verse eid="JUD 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />Mu dyambu ti, kuu na bantu bambi bakotidi mu kinsweki ha kati dyeno. Bantu bebobo kitumbu kyawu ntama kisonama, mu dyambu ti bakwe balulanga mulemvo wu Nzambi eto, mwanki baba na kimpwanza mu sadila kinsuza na bakwe nyafunanga Yesu-Klisto, Mulongisi eto wumosi kaka na Mfumu eto.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />Nzebi ti walutomini zaba bumbote, kansi ntiidi mu lubambula moyo ti Mfumu wuvuukisa bantu ba-Isaeli ku nsi yi Ngipiti, mboki wusa ti yobobo balembolo mukwikila bafwa. <verse eid="JUD 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />Bambukeeno moyo mu zimbazi zilembana mu keba bibuka bi buzitu byo Nzambi bi kabatuula, banyafuna bibuka byawu: ni kabakanga mu misinga mi bisengo. Bayendila bakangama ku kitombe kii ku nsi mimvu ka mimvu, natee mu kilumbu kikinene ki mfundusu. <verse eid="JUD 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />Bambukeeno moyo zimbanza zi Sodomo na Ngomola na zimbanza zilembolo ba nawu kitatu: Bantu bedi zinganga mu mbanza bezozo, bakiyekola mu kinsuza bonso buba zimbazi bezozo, na basosa dyaka mu vukisa nitu mulembolo zitisa Misiku. Yawu bana tambula mpasi zi tiya tu mimvu ka mimvu, yiyiyi nkatika ndwengosolo yidi ku bantu bamvimba.<verse eid="JUD 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Bumosi mpe, bantu bebobo bakota mu kinsweki ha kati dyeno nkadulu yibobo yii nawu: mayindu mawu makwe banatanga mu sumuna nitu zawu, mpe bakwe safulanga kimfumu ki Nzambi, na bakwe tyakanga zimbazi zii mu nkembo ku mazulu. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" />Mikali, mfumu yi zimbazi, kasa bo ko. Bu kedi bindana mpaka na Nkadyampemba mu nwanina nitu yi Mose, Mikali katonta mu mufunda mu mpova zi busafu ko, kansi wumuteela ti: «Bika Mfumu kakusemba!» <verse eid="JUD 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Bantu bebobo bakwe tyakanga myo mi balembolo zaba, kansi myo mi bazebi, mu kimuntu kyawu kwandi bazabidi myo bonso bibulu bilembolo ba na madyela. Myamyomyo mikwe bazimbisanga. <verse eid="JUD 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />Kyadi ku yawu! Mu dyambu ti balanda nzila yi Kayini. Mu dyambu di mufutu, bakiyekola mu nzimbukusu bonso Balami. Mpe yawu bafwa bu banangumuka bonso busa Kole<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kayini</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: tala <char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 4:3-8">Mba 4.3-8</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:35">Mat 23.35</ref></char> note. – </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Balami</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: tala <char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 22:1-35">Ltg 22.1-35</ref></char>. – </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kole</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: tala <char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 16:1-35">Ltg 16.1-35</ref></char> </char></note>. <verse eid="JUD 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Yawu bakwe tesisanga masakuba mu ntangu yi lukwe dyanga bindya bi kimpangi. Bakwe dyanga mpe bakwe nwanga ka mu yena nsoni ko, nitu zawu kwandi bakwe banzilanga. Badi bonso matuti mana kwe nati mupepe wulembolo mvula. Badi mpe bonso miti milembolo ba na mimbutu mu ntangu yi ntombo, mpe bu bavuza myo, mitomini fwa nkatika kufwa. <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />Bantu bebobo, bafwanakani bonso bipo bingolo bi mamba ma mubu. Bakwe mwanganga mavanga mawu mansoni bonso bipo bikwe loosanga mubu. Badi bonso zimbwetete zikwe kwe dyengidingi. Nzambi wubalundila kibuka ki mimvu ka mimvu ku nsye tombe kii na bokoboko.<verse eid="JUD 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />Ni mu dyambu dyawu mpe Enoki, nkaka yi nsambwadi tuuka Adami, kabikudila ebu: «Tala! Mfumu waakwiza na makumi ma mafunda ma zimbazi zandi zilongo, <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />mu fundisa bantu bamvimba. Waabedisa bantu bamvimba bambi mu mavanga mawu ma basadila na waababedisa mu mpova zimbalu zi baduukisa ha ntadisi andi.» <verse eid="JUD 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />Ntangu zimvimba, bantu bebobo bana kwe vunguti na bana kwe nyongi. Bana kwe landi nsatu zawu zimbi, bana kwe duukisi mpova zi mayama mpe bana kwe lebi bantu mu babakila ndandu.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndwengosolo na ntumunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Kansi yeno zimpangi zani zizola, bambukeeno moyo mu misamu mi balusamunina, tuuka ntama, ku zintumwa zi Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" />Mu dyambu ti, baluteela ti: «Mu bilumbu bimanunu, kwaaba na bantu baaluyodila mpe baadyatila bonso budi nsatu zawu zimbi.» <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />Ni yabobo bakwe twalanga nkabani. Mboki bakwe twadusungu mu nsatu zawu zi kimuntu, kansi ka mu Mpeve yi Nzambi ko. <verse eid="JUD 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />Kansi, yeno zimpangi zani, tatamaneeno mu tunga luzingu lweno ha lufulu lu kiminu kyeno kilongo. Sambileeno mu lulendo lu Mpeve Yilongo. <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />Tatamaneeno muba mu kati di luzolo lu Nzambi, bu luna kingila nkenda zi mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto mu baka luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu.<verse eid="JUD 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Beeno na nkenda ku ba nga maketiketi. <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />Bavuukiseeno mu basa kitatu na tiya tu mfundusu. Fwileeno bahiika nkenda. Kansi kebeeno kweno mu ba kintwadi nawu, mu dyambu ti binkutu byawu bii na mvindu mu mavanga mawu mambi.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkembo ku Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Ku yondowo wulendi lukeba mu kyonso kibwa, mpe wulendi luyenikisa wulembolo kyeta na bafuluka mu kyese ha ntadisi yi nkembo andi, <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />ku Nzambi yimosi kwandi yidi Muvuukisi eto, mu nzila yi Yesu-Klisto, Mfumu eto. Bika ti nkembo, bunene, lulendo mpe kimfumu biba nandi, tuuka mu mbadukulu, bwabu natee mu ntangu zimvimba! Ameni!<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>